# …but DO version the Rust app lockfile: this is a binary app, so a committed
# Cargo.lock pins transitive deps and keeps CI builds reproducible (prevents a
# floating dep — e.g. bitflags 2.12.0 — from silently breaking the macOS build).
!src-tauri/Cargo.lock
